<h3><u>Haey Shaam</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><b><u><font size=""4""><p>Haey Shaam</p>
</font></u></b><p><font size=""4"">(Shaam Haey Shaam Haey Shaam Haey Shaam) x2</font></p><font size=""4"">
<p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p>
<ol><li>Naizon Peh Shahidon Kay Sar Hain Beemar(a.s.) Bhi Chalta Jaata Hai</li><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Zanjeer Ulajh Kar Peron Say Kehti Hai Yeh Ghum Kay Maaron Say</li><p>Kuch Dair Mein Paththar Barseingay</p><p>Is Shehr Kay Baala Khanon Say Sajjad(a.s.) Ka Dil Gharbrata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><p>Be Ghar Hain Musafir Bechadar Hai Kitni Aziyat Ka Yeh Safar</p><p>Bazoo Hain Bandhay Maan Behnon Kay</p><p>Sar Baap(a.s.) Chacha(a.s.) Kay Khoon Mein Tar Beemar(a.s.) Bohat Sharmata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Eik Rassi Hai Aur Bara Galay Yeh Qafla Aakhir Kaisay Chalay</li><p>Jalti Hai Zamin Kanton Say Bhari</p><p>Ronay Lagay Peron Kay Chalay Khoon Zakhmon Say Rista Jata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Kothon Peh Tamashai Hain Kharhay Aur Shaam Kay Baam-o-Dar Hain Sajay</li><p>Ummat Hai Nabi(s.a.w.w.) Ki Chaar Taraf</p><p>Parhti Hai Nabi(s.a.w.w.) Zadi(s.a.) Khutbay Aur Ashk Falak Barsata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Darbaar Ka Dar Nazdeek Aya Bazaar-e-Sitam Ab Khatm Hua</li><p>Kuch Dair Aseeron(a.s.) Ko Roko</p><p>Yeh Hukm-e-Yazidi Hai Aya Darbar Sajaya Jata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Darbar-e-Sitam Ki Aaraish Aur Takht-e-Laen Ki Zebaish</li><p>Jab Hochuki Poori Tab Jakar</p><p>Badkar Nay Ki Yeh Farmaish Lo Jashn Manaya Jata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Ba Parda Kanizein Baithi Hain Saidanian Saari Roti Hain</li><p>Fizza(s.a.) Ko Banakar Jab Parda</p><p>Zehra(s.a.) Ki Betian(s.a.) Chupti Hain Sajjad Ko Ghash Ajata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Zalim Nay Ajab Yeh Kaam Kia Zainab(s.a.) Ka Achanak Naam Lia</li><p>Ghabrakay Ali(a.s.) Ki Beti(s.a.) Nay</p><p>Haathon Say Jigar Ko Thaam Lia Abid(a.s.) Ko Jalal Aajata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Zanjeer Chatakh Kar Toot Gai Beemar(a.s.) Nay Eik Angrhai Jo Li</li><p>Darbar-e-Sitam Mein Shor Utha</p><p>Kia Aaj Najaf Say Aaey Ali(a.s.) Ya Waqt-e-Qayamat Aata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Darbar Say Jab Zindan Mein Gaey Sajjad(a.s.) Phophi(s.a.) Say Kehnay Lagay</li><p>Yeh Kaisa Andhera Zindan Hai</p><p>Yaan Zinda Raheingay Hum(a.s.) Kaisay Dil Mera Dooba Jata Hai</p><p>(Haey Shaam Ki Galian Aaein Hai) x2 </p><li>Zindaan Mein Sakina(s.a.) Nay Poocha Ghar Jaengay Hum(a.s.) Kis Din Bhaiyya(a.s.)</li></ol>

<p>Ya Aur Koi Baqi Hai Sitam</p>
<p>Ghut Ta Hai Yahan To Dam Mera Ab Saans Ukharhta Jata Hai</p></font></p>
